  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Promoci&#xF3;n de esfuerzos anticorrupci&#xF3;n (PACE)</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Promoting Anti-corruption Efforts (PACE)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Promoci&#xF3;n de Esfuerzos Anticorrupci&#xF3;n (PACE) busca desarrollar sistemas o procesos de adquisiciones gubernamentales transparentes y basados &#x200B;&#x200B;en el m&#xE9;rito en las &#xE1;reas de telecomunicaciones, energ&#xED;a y/o infraestructura a nivel local o nacional en Ecuador.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Promoting Anti-corruption Efforts (PACE) seeks to develop merit-based and transparent government procurement systems or processes in the areas of telecommunications, energy and/or infrastructure at the local or national level in Ecuador.</narrative>
  </description>
